/T (Method.normalise\(\) strips the text, removes spaces and hyphens with replace\(\) and converts to upper case. is_valid\(\) checks that the length is 9 or 10 and then checks each part by slicing: reg[:2].isalpha\(\), reg[2:4].isdigit\(\), reg[4:-4].isalpha\(\) \(the series of 1 or 2 letters\) and reg[-4:].isdigit\(\). format_plate\(\) joins the four slices with spaces. )
