/T (Correct design. Use None as the default and create a new list inside the function body \(if order is None: order = []\). None is immutable, so nothing is shared between calls. )
/E (Correct design. Use None as the default and create a new list inside the function body \(if order is None: order = []\). None is immutable, so nothing is shared between calls. )
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
828 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 181 0 R
/T (Parameter types. Positional arguments are used for required, obvious values in a fixed order \(item, order\). Keyword arguments make calls self-explanatory and allow any order \(bill\(order=..., gst_rate=0.18\)\). Default parameters are for optional values with a sensible default \(GST rate 5%\), and they must be immutable. )
/E (Parameter types. Positional arguments are used for required, obvious values in a fixed order \(item, order\). Keyword arguments make calls self-explanatory and allow any order \(bill\(order=..., gst_rate=0.18\)\). Default parameters are for optional values with a sensible default \(GST rate 5%\), and they must be immutable. )
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
