/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 187 0 R
/T (Deployment decision \(n = 1,000\). The default recursion limit is 1,000 frames \(sys.getrecursionlimit\(\)\), so the memoised function, which goes 1,000 levels deep, raises RecursionError. Raising the limit with sys.setrecursionlimit\(\) works for this input, but it is only a stop- gap: every levelusesstackmemory,andaverylargelimitcancrashtheinterpreter.Decision:usethe loop version fordeploymentbecauseitneedsnostackandhasnolimit,andkeepthememoised version only forclarityorsmallinputs.Theplainrecursiveversioncannotberunforn=1,000)
/E (Deployment decision \(n = 1,000\). The default recursion limit is 1,000 frames \(sys.getrecursionlimit\(\)\), so the memoised function, which goes 1,000 levels deep, raises RecursionError. Raising the limit with sys.setrecursionlimit\(\) works for this input, but it is only a stop- gap: every levelusesstackmemory,andaverylargelimitcancrashtheinterpreter.Decision:usethe loop version fordeploymentbecauseitneedsnostackandhasnolimit,andkeepthememoised version only forclarityorsmallinputs.Theplainrecursiveversioncannotberunforn=1,000)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [25]
>>
