/Title (Counter bugs. If the counter is incremented before the blank check, blank entries are counted as attempts and a customer is locked out unfairly. If the increment is placed after a continue, or is forgotten, the loop condition never becomes false and a kiosk that keeps receiving blank entries loops forever. The counter must be updated exactly once, after a real entry is received and before the result is checked.)
